@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Listar todos os apontamentos
GET {{baseUrl}}/apontamentos
Content-Type: application/json

### Buscar apontamento por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/apontamentos/1
Content-Type: application/json

### Buscar apontamentos por usuário
GET {{baseUrl}}/apontamentos/usuario/9428b54f-709f-4e7f-82af-810d1b426f6e
Content-Type: application/json

### Atualizar apontamento
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/apontamentos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "horaFim": "2026-04-06T13:00:00",
  "observacao": "Ajuste de horário final"
}

### Deletar apontamento
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/apontamentos/1
Content-Type: application/json

### Criar apontamento (Item 1 - MSF)
POST {{baseUrl}}/apontamentos
Content-Type: application/json

{
"itemId": 1,
"usuarioId": "9428b54f-709f-4e7f-82af-810d1b426f6e",
"dataApontamento": "2026-04-06T00:00:00",
"horaInicio": "2026-04-06T08:00:00",
"horaFim": "2026-04-06T12:00:00",
"pausaInicio": "2026-04-06T10:00:00",
"pausaFim": "2026-04-06T10:15:00",
"observacao": "Desenvolvimento inicial do sistema"
}

